<title>USA: El Paso Energy Q4 shr $0.61 vs $0.67.</title>
<headline>El Paso Energy Q4 shr $0.61 vs $0.67.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.61		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			 24,227		   22,904</p>
<p> Revs		   1,072,281		  408,525</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	39,591		   34,216</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.06		    $2.47</p>
<p> Net			 38,211		   85,363</p>
<p> Revs		   3,010,063		1,037,997</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	36,149		   34,495</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 includes a $99 million pre-tax charge taken in the first quarter for employee separation and asset impairment and a $8 million per-tax charge taken in the fourth quarter for relocating the corporate headquarters from El Paso to Houston in connection with the acquisition of Tenneco Energy.</p>
<p>Note: Q4 earnings per share before non-recurring charges was $0.73 versus $0.67. For the year, EPS before non-recurring charges was $2.85 versus $2.47 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
